{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026164602608-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026173137\"/><p>私煙被搬上岸。</p><p>今午(26日)12時50分，長洲東灣泳灘職員報案，指有多個包有香煙的可疑箱子被浪沖上沙灘。警員接報到場共檢獲21個箱子，懷疑箱內的香煙均為未完稅的私煙，案件轉交海關跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:45.483091+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:46:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12.138421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:09.619718+00:00","content_hash":"b208571221b3bec75722e2d205121912340bbc86ae39ec5858aab0440c827407","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}